---
---
<section class="section worm-ivory">
  <div class="section-gap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header center">
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge-dot"></div>
          <div>process</div>
        </div>
        <div class="max-width-55">
          <h2 class="section-heading">How our care works</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <div to-top-0="" class="process-left">
          <div class="process-card active">
            <div class="process-card-top">
              <div class="process-card-top-left">
                <div class="process-number-wrap">
                  <div>01</div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-card-title active">Book Your Appointment</div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-arrow-wrap active"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="process-arrow">
                  <path d="M10 15.4183V4.16821" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                  <path d="M15 10.835C15 10.835 11.3176 15.8349 10 15.835C8.68233 15.835 5 10.835 5 10.835" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-bottom active">
              <div class="process-summary-wrap">
                <p>Choose a time that suits you online or by phone. Our care team confirms your visit, shares what to bring, and answers any questions before you arrive, so your first day at the clinic feels calm, simple and fully prepared from the moment you walk in the door.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-card-top">
              <div class="process-card-top-left">
                <div class="process-number-wrap">
                  <div>02</div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-card-title">Initial Consultation</div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-arrow-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="process-arrow">
                  <path d="M10 15.4183V4.16821" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                  <path d="M15 10.835C15 10.835 11.3176 15.8349 10 15.835C8.68233 15.835 5 10.835 5 10.835" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-bottom">
              <div class="process-summary-wrap">
                <p>Meet a women&#x27;s health specialist to talk through your concerns, symptoms and goals. We review your medical history in detail, listen closely to your needs and explain every option clearly before we suggest the next steps for your own personal care plan.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-card-top">
              <div class="process-card-top-left">
                <div class="process-number-wrap">
                  <div>03</div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-card-title">Tests &amp; Diagnosis</div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-arrow-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="process-arrow">
                  <path d="M10 15.4183V4.16821" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                  <path d="M15 10.835C15 10.835 11.3176 15.8349 10 15.835C8.68233 15.835 5 10.835 5 10.835" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-bottom">
              <div class="process-summary-wrap">
                <p>We run hormone panels, ultrasound scans and fertility assessments in our on-site lab. Clear results help us find the real cause very quickly, and your doctor walks you through each finding so you can choose the right treatment path with full confidence.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-card-top">
              <div class="process-card-top-left">
                <div class="process-number-wrap">
                  <div>04</div>
                </div>
                <div class="process-card-title">Treatment &amp; Care</div>
              </div>
              <div class="process-arrow-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="process-arrow">
                  <path d="M10 15.4183V4.16821" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                  <path d="M15 10.835C15 10.835 11.3176 15.8349 10 15.835C8.68233 15.835 5 10.835 5 10.835" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke="currentColor"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card-bottom">
              <div class="process-summary-wrap">
                <p>Our specialists create a personal treatment plan using proven methods and modern equipment. We focus on your comfort, safety and long-term health at every stage, with regular follow-up visits and a caring team that stays right by your side throughout.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div to-top-2="" class="process-right"><img src="/images/photo-team-03-1.webp" loading="lazy" width="1725" height="1785" alt="Pregnant woman lying on an examination bed receiving an ultrasound scan on her belly; a medical professional holds the ultrasound probe while operating the machine." srcset="/images/photo-team-03-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/photo-team-03-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/photo-team-03-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/photo-team-03-1-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/photo-team-03-1.webp 1725w" sizes="(max-width: 1725px) 100vw, 1725px" class="process-image"><img src="/images/Pregnancy-measurements.webp" loading="lazy" width="1631" height="426" alt="Pregnancy measurements display showing length 5.13 ounces, weight 0.57 grams, and a circular progress bar indicating 208 days." srcset="/images/Pregnancy-measurements-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Pregnancy-measurements-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Pregnancy-measurements-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Pregnancy-measurements-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Pregnancy-measurements.webp 1631w" sizes="(max-width: 1631px) 100vw, 1631px" class="process-bottom-image"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
